een with my brother on PS and I fell in love with it so much I got mine for PC just after, and been playing it a lot since.\nSuper funny voices, nice missions, tons of weapons, nice variety of classes and giant battles in a scale I never seen in a coop shooter. EVER. Seriosly. I played other games that try to do large scale battles, and I like those too. But after playing this one, I cant help but feel like all those others are just pretending to do large battles, while this one go bananas with it LOL. And there is NO freaking game lag, even with the screen full of enemies and explosions!\nOBS: Only negative I could find (and is a huge one) is that the grind/farm to get weapons to max stats is mental, horrible. You have to kill a monster, then maybe it drops a weapon crate, then maybe is the weapon you want, then maybe is the stats u want to level, then maybe is the max lvl of that stat. The guy who came up with this must have no mother.... lol", "timestamp_created": 1709159530, "timestamp_updated": 1788551074, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "159472627", "author": {"steamid": "76561198410443653", "personaname": "Amazingtanker1", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198410443653/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2084, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 813, "last_played": 1709484677, "avatar": "1454c7d29372359bf8b4b3f42b4158b837f41c9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Game is very fun to play", "timestamp_created": 1709130583, "timestamp_updated": 1709130583, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_f